1
00:00:00,967 --> 00:00:04,104
First, select the “CTA Canvas”

2
00:00:04,104 --> 00:00:08,875
Create “Hotspot Area” and set it as “Associate Images”

3
00:00:08,875 --> 00:00:13,246
You can adjust the “Display Setting” & “Activation Method”

4
00:00:13,246 --> 00:00:18,418
You may upload the images offline or add from your “Media Library”

5
00:00:18,418 --> 00:00:24,791
You can decide how this feature to be displayed

6
00:00:24,791 --> 00:00:30,230
You can add shadow and stroke of your display as well

7
00:00:30,230 --> 00:00:37,270
Each image can be added with an unique url

8
00:00:37,270 --> 00:00:46,046
The “Associate Images” can be toggled through your mouse roller
